    "headline": "After 100 GRPO steps, the selected 0.5B LoRA solved one more held-out internal repair greedily (5/12 to 6/12) and one more frozen HumanEvalFix task (37/164 to 38/164), while internal candidate failures fell from 23/60 to 10/60, largely through fewer malformed outputs.",
